{"version":1,"key":"card:3","content":{"id":3,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2db7c2c6-a868-49cf-be68-5445011180ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"突然不知道遇到什么问题，无法将代码推送到 Github 了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Shell","uuid":"d9459ea2-bfd3-4387-b390-7cbbd7892842","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d57b5364-f86c-4d9c-986a-0ec563a6b7f6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# git push -u origin master\nEnumerating objects: 248, done.\nCounting objects: 100% (248/248), done.\nDelta compression using up to 8 threads\nCompressing objects: 100% (222/222), done.\nclient_loop: send disconnect: Broken pipe | 86.00 KiB/s\nsend-pack: unexpected disconnect while reading sideband packet\nfatal: sha1 file '<stdout>' write error: Broken pipeB/s\nfatal: the remote end hung up unexpectedly","collabId":"4d3562f3-a0ef-4ac3-842e-5fbbceba5fd7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"160f631e-92a4-4452-a18c-0c557a147737","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"网上搜了一番，说是要增加超时时间，在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"~/.ssh/config"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中设置如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"YAML","uuid":"f5bc8c8a-ae81-495d-98ba-cac0285de97c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"bec665c3-3178-4f38-92c8-438fb1990127","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Host github.com\n  HostName ssh.github.com\n  IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_rsa_github\n  Port 443\n  # ProxyCommand connect -H 127.0.0.1:7890 %h %p\n  # 新增下面\n  ServerAliveInterval 300\n  ServerAliveCountMax 2\n  TCPKeepAlive yes","collabId":"6660766d-ce1d-4c8d-a0e4-26b37865d47a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"68cf724b-a7ef-4449-b8ba-4f85c559bc0b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后就可以了，不过这里我把我的代理也去掉了，不知道哪个生效了😂。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"520f76a6-0804-4b92-91b7-235489b99f04","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"53329fc0-45ed-41da-ab90-b388345ddce5","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b594adf1-af7c-41f9-8492-742a158aeb44","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"41adc630-1680-4a1f-92e9-0819d44d6aa3","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://unix.stackexchange.com/questions/602518/ssh-connection-client-loop-send-disconnect-broken-pipe-or-connection-reset?newreg=b8498455c3fe4343b900540cf1cab9be","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"4016a158-803d-489c-9bdd-240ab2e43f73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ssh connection \"client_loop: send disconnect: Broken pipe\" or \"Connection reset by <IP> port 22\""}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["Git/踩坑","踩坑/Git"],"createTime":1688905814333,"updateTime":1752924433243,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924433243}}